                                "sense_id": "e92d0bc8-53ab-3198-a0de-6c7f485a1cfc",
                                "text": "Itm̄ es gieng ein schyff vō Alkeier gen Cōstātinopel das hat 3 segel / vn̄ mit dē groͤstē segel ging es 2 monat / mit dē andern 3 / vn̄ mit de[m] kleinstē 4. Nū ist die frag : wan man al 3 segel vff gespant vn̄ doch in einē wint / in wieuil monet kem das schiff da hyn.",
                                "translation": "Further: Suppose a ship, which has 3 sails, were going from Cairo to Constantinople. With the largest sail it would travel 2 months, with the medium one 3 months, and with the smallest 4 months. Now the question is: If all 3 sails had been hoisted and a wind did come up, within how many months would the ship get there?",
                                "english": "Further: Suppose a ship, which has 3 sails, were going from Cairo to Constantinople. With the largest sail it would travel 2 months, with the medium one 3 months, and with the smallest 4 months. Now the question is: If all 3 sails had been hoisted and a wind did come up, within how many months would the ship get there?"
